<title>USA: Premier Parks to acquire Elitch assets.</title>
<headline>Premier Parks to acquire Elitch assets.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premier Parks Inc said on Friday it signed a contract to acquire assets of Elitch Gardens amusement park in Denver, Colorado.</p>
<p>The purchase price was not disclosed.</p>
<p>Premier Parks, a national theme park company, signed a similar contract last month to acquire the assets of a combination theme and water park.</p>
